---
import ToolLayout from '../components/ToolLayout.astro';
import CompressTool from '../tools/compress/CompressTool';
---

<ToolLayout
  title="Compress images online free: JPG, PNG, WebP | iDuckImg"
  description="Reduce image file size in your browser. Compress JPG, PNG and WebP with no upload and no signup. Your files never leave your device."
  heading="Compress images"
>
  <CompressTool client:load />
  <section slot="content" class="prose">
    <h2>How to compress an image</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Drop your JPG, PNG or WebP files, or paste them.</li>
      <li>Pick a quality. Around 75 keeps photos looking the same at a much smaller size.</li>
      <li>Press Compress and download each file, or all of them as a ZIP.</li>
    </ol>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm">
      JPG and WebP are compressed with adjustable quality. PNG is optimized losslessly, so the
      picture is unchanged but savings are smaller. If a file cannot be made smaller, you get the
      original back.
    </p>
  </section>
</ToolLayout>
